[length:06:21]
[ti:Born to love each other]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Aracne]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.2]
[00:02.72]I helped you into the world...
[00:06.84]and somehow
[00:09.73]you kept me in it.
[00:16.85]There was a green girl
[00:19.57]in the middle of my chest
[00:21.32]I built a little church there
[00:24.97]and I called it 
[00:27.44]devotion
[00:30.88]Eighteen years of kneeling
[00:34.00]to a light I thought I knew
[00:37.06]I wrote “together forever”
[00:40.09]like a spell inside the room
[00:44.98]But forever went silent
[00:47.38]and answered nothing at all
[00:51.64]and I stood there with my hands out
[00:54.01]praying to a failed human
[00:58.95]Then you came soft-footed
[01:00.45]through the wreckage and the dust
[01:02.10]not asking for devotion
[01:03.68]not demanding to be loved
[01:05.81]You didn’t wear the crown she dropped
[01:07.48]you didn’t take her name
[01:09.19]you just curled into the hollow
[01:10.87]and made the hollow warm again
[01:13.63]I helped you into the world
[01:16.72]and somehow
[01:18.49]you kept me in it
[01:20.89]I gave you your first breath
[01:23.35]you gave me one more minute
[01:26.95]No altar could hold me
[01:29.86]no starlight could do
[01:33.46]what your little heart does
[01:36.28]when it beats against me too
[01:41.17]We were born to love each other
[01:44.65]we were born to love each other
[01:48.51]No betrayal
[01:50.15]no excuses
[01:51.87]only you
[01:52.95]only me
[01:54.06]only us
[01:55.89]Only carey girl
[01:57.56]in a house of orange flames
[01:59.09]only daughter in the chaos
[02:01.29]with a face they couldn’t name
[02:03.95]They called you ugly
[02:05.51]like beauty was the point
[02:06.65]but you were made of patches
[02:08.35]like a secret map only I could read
[02:10.00]A little broken painting
[02:11.50]with the universe in your eyes
[02:13.15]you look at me in silence
[02:14.98]and the whole world stands still
[02:17.05]You only become yourself
[02:18.64]when the world leaves the room
[02:20.65]and I only become softer
[02:22.39]when I’m breathing next to you
[02:23.80]No one knows the language
[02:25.39]that you press into my skin
[02:27.34]no one hears the sentence
[02:28.90]when you squirm and show me your secrets
[02:31.21]You don’t know what you saved me from
[02:33.31]you don’t know what you do
[02:34.93]you just sleep above the ending
[02:37.06]like the ending isn’t true
[02:39.70]Only us in a giant bed
[02:41.98]holding hands until the end
[02:44.50]your little pompom paws in the dark
[02:48.16]my cheerleader, my little guard
[02:51.52]I helped you into the world
[02:54.40]and somehow
[02:56.53]you kept me in it
[02:58.72]I gave you your first breath
[03:01.27]you gave me one more minute
[03:04.93]No altar could hold me
[03:08.14]no starlight could do
[03:11.86]what your little heart does
[03:14.77]when it beats against me too
[03:18.44]We were born to love each other
[03:22.23]we were born to love each other
[03:25.78]No betrayal
[03:27.66]no excuses
[03:29.39]only you
[03:30.80]only me
[03:31.84]only us
[03:33.19]just your pompom hands
[03:35.44]making me live
[03:36.96]one more day
[03:39.56]Only you
[03:41.26]only me
[03:42.96]only us
[03:46.81]I don’t want green altars
[03:48.28]I don’t want the holy lie
[03:49.86]I don’t want a love that leaves me
[03:51.92]begging language for a sign
[03:53.44]You never said forever
[03:55.04]you never swore you’d stay
[03:56.82]you just came to me each morning
[03:58.63]and put warmth where I decayed
[04:00.39]I helped you into the world
[04:02.21]blood and breath and tiny cries
[04:03.94]then you held me to the living
[04:05.72]with your strange, unpretty eyes
[04:07.57]Not to fix me
[04:08.85]not to save me
[04:09.73]not to be the reason why
[04:11.15]just because you knew my soul
[04:12.53]as the place where you could lie
[04:16.18]No walls between us
[04:19.74]no polite little distance
[04:22.97]you climb onto my back
[04:25.07]and I let you sleep in me
[04:27.43]because you are not outside me
[04:34.28]because I am not outside you
[04:42.89]I helped you into the world
[04:45.24]and somehow
[04:46.38]you kept me in it
[04:48.32]I gave you your first breath
[04:51.72]you gave me one more minute
[04:54.97]Above the green altar
[04:56.89]above the starlight
[04:58.36]above every death
[04:59.72]I learned to survive
[05:03.06]you put your little heart on mine
[05:05.19]and I knew
[05:07.13]I knew
[05:08.81]We were born to love each other
[05:11.83]we were born to love each other
[05:15.32]not like a chain
[05:16.73]not like a claim
[05:18.24]like a body remembers its name
[05:22.57]little patchwork god
[05:24.29]little universe eyes
[05:25.53]you kept me here
[05:27.00]you kept me alive
[05:28.94]my tiny cheerleader
[05:30.36]with your pompom hands
[05:32.04]you don’t know the war
[05:33.56]but you help me stand
[05:35.73]We were born to love each other
[05:38.89]we were born to love each other
[05:42.32]No betrayal
[05:44.04]no excuses
[05:45.95]only you
[05:48.12]only me
[05:49.37]only us
[05:54.82]I helped you into the world...
[05:58.99]and somehow
[06:02.45]you kept me in it.
[06:07.72]No altar.
[06:09.33]No starlight.
[06:11.36]Only you and me
[06:14.56]holding hands
[06:16.23]all night long.
